        "kind": "real",
        "src": "530-the-first-x-ray-showed-a-ring-0.jpg",
        "fit": "card",
        "label": "Wilhelm Roentgen",
        "credit": "Public domain, via Wikimedia Commons"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "He called them X rays, with X standing for the unknown.",
      "scene": {
        "kind": "piece",
        "piece": "necklace",
        "stone": "emerald",
        "metal": "platinum",
        "label": "X for unknown",
        "cut": "emerald"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "Then he laid his wife's hand over a photographic plate.",
      "scene": {
        "kind": "piece",
        "piece": "earrings",
        "stone": "morganite",
        "metal": "yellow",
        "label": "A photographic plate",
        "cut": "pear"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "That was on December 22, 1895.",
      "say": "That was on December twenty second, eighteen ninety five.",
      "scene": {
        "kind": "title",
        "text": "Dec 22, 1895",
        "sub": "The first picture",
        "piece": "ring",
        "stone": "aquamarine",
        "metal": "yellow",
        "cut": "oval"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "The picture showed the bones of her hand.",
      "scene": {
        "kind": "real",
        "src": "530-the-first-x-ray-showed-a-ring-1.jpg",
        "fit": "card",
        "label": "The first X ray, 1895",
        "credit": "Public domain, via Wikimedia Commons"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "Around one finger was a dark band, her wedding ring.",
      "scene": {
        "kind": "real",
        "src": "530-the-first-x-ray-showed-a-ring-2.jpg",
        "fit": "card",
        "focus": {
          "x": 0.33,
          "y": 0.4,
          "k": 1.9
        },
        "label": "Her wedding ring",
        "credit": "Public domain, via Wikimedia Commons"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "He published his findings before the year ended.",
      "scene": {
        "kind": "piece",
        "piece": "bracelet",
        "stone": "sapphire",
        "metal": "yellow",
        "label": "A paper on new rays"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "He mailed copies of the picture to physicists across Europe.",
      "scene": {
        "kind": "piece",
        "piece": "brooch",
        "stone": "ruby",
        "metal": "platinum",
        "label": "Copies across Europe",
        "cut": "round",
        "petals": 8
